# headwear/cloth/circlet: the Circlet (OUTER, P2b wave 2): a thin band of the person's trim metal (brass by default) round the brow,
# over the hair, a gem in the accent colour at the front; it hides no hair (the hair keeps its full style).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role headwear circlet
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
legend m accent 0
legend p accent 3

# (P5b SIG FR1) begin suntemple-band: the Sun Temple T1 headband: the band off the hair, the sun disc, the tall feather, the knot's tails
legend ^ plume 0
legend _ plume 1
legend ` plume 2
legend { plume 3
legend } plume 4
legend ~ head 0
legend ( head 1
legend ) head 2
legend k head 3
legend l head 4
view D key rest origin 2 0 when sighelm-suntemple,!helm.t2
