# (P5b SIG C) begin sylvan-leaves: the Sylvan T1 leaf circlet: a forest band set with leaves, the end sprigs swept back
legend ! plume 1
legend $ plume 2
legend % plume 3
legend & plume 4
legend * head 0
legend + head 1
legend , head 2
legend / head 3
view D key rest origin 3 -2 when sighelm-sylvan,!helm.t2 replace
