# (P5b SIG C) end sylvan-leaves
# (P5b SIG C) begin sylvan-crown: the Sylvan T2 leaf crown: five upright leaves high on the head, the outer ones swept back
legend : plume 1
legend ; plume 2
legend < plume 3
legend = plume 4
legend > head 0
legend ? head 1
legend [ head 2
legend ] head 3
